---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<title>Arbalest - Untamed Weapons</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<nav class="nav">
			<div class="container">
				<a href="/" class="logo">UNTAMED</a>
				<div class="nav-links">
					<a href="/rules">Rules</a>
					<a href="/quick-reference">Quick Reference</a>
					<a href="/character">Characters</a>
					<a href="/bestiary">Bestiary</a>
					<a href="/gm-guide">GM Guide</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<main>
			<div class="container">
				<div class="breadcrumb">
					<a href="/character">← Back to Character Creation</a>
				</div>

				<header class="page-header">
					<div class="weapon-icon"><img src="/weapons/Arbalest.png" alt="Arbalest" /></div>
					<h1>Arbalest</h1>
					<p class="subtitle">Heavy Gunner / Lane Control</p>
					<div class="stat-badges">
						<span class="stat-badge">+1 INT</span>
						<span class="stat-badge">+1 DEX</span>
					</div>
				</header>

				<article class="content">
					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Overview</h2>
						<p>The Arbalest is a weapon for hunters who think in lanes. Plant your feet, build Tension, and fire shots that punch through AR and pin prey to the ground. Every technique reinforces the same identity: you plan your position, you hold it, and anything that moves through your line pays for it. Enemies that shove, drag, or rattle you break your setup — so does hesitation.</p>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Weapon Attributes</h2>
						<div class="attributes-grid">
							<div class="attribute-card">
								<h3>Tags</h3>
								<ul>
									<li>Mechanical</li>
									<li>Reload</li>
									<li>Two-Handed</li>
									<li>Rooting (while Braced)</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="attribute-card">
								<h3>Attack &amp; Save Stat</h3>
								<p class="formula">Intelligence</p>
								<p style="margin-top: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.9rem;">Save DC: 10 + INT mod + proficiency</p>
								<p style="font-size: 0.9rem;">Range: 30/120 ft. Disadvantage beyond 120 ft.</p>
							</div>
							<div class="attribute-card">
								<h3>Reload</h3>
								<p>Must Load after each shot. Load costs a Fast Action or Action (1 Stamina) and generates +1 Tension.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section highlight">
						<h2>Core Mechanic — Tension</h2>
						<p>The Arbalest rewards stillness. The longer you hold your position and build Tension, the harder your shot hits. Movement is the enemy of power.</p>
						<div class="mechanic-details">
							<h3>The Loop</h3>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>Brace (no Stamina):</strong> If you have at least half your Speed remaining, spend all remaining movement to Brace and gain <strong>+1 Tension</strong>. While Braced: Speed = 0; you can't Dash, Climb, or Swim.</li>
								<li><strong>Load (Fast Action or Action, 1 Stamina):</strong> Must Load after each shot. Gain <strong>+1 Tension</strong>.</li>
								<li><strong>Fire (Action):</strong> Consume all Tension and resolve the attack.</li>
							</ul>

							<h3>Tension Thresholds</h3>
							<p><em>Bonuses apply only if you are Braced when you Fire.</em></p>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>Tension 1:</strong> +1 to your Attack roll.</li>
								<li><strong>Tension 2:</strong> +2 to your Attack roll and <strong>+1 Power Die</strong> to damage.</li>
							</ul>

							<h3>Losing Tension</h3>
							<ul>
								<li>When you Fire.</li>
								<li>When Brace ends (you move or are moved).</li>
								<li>If you are knocked Prone, Staggered, or Stunned.</li>
							</ul>
							<p style="margin-bottom: 0;"><em>Moving (or being moved against your will) ends Brace and sets Tension to 0. Enemies that shove, drag, or rattle you are breaking your setup on purpose.</em></p>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Bolt Cartridges</h2>
						<p>Standard bolts are unlimited. Special cartridges refresh each hunt. Unless stated otherwise, special shots benefit from Tension and still require Load after firing.</p>

						<div class="arbalest-card offense">
							<div class="arbalest-header">
								<h3>Bone Arbalest</h3>
								<span class="arbalest-tag">Offense</span>
							</div>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>Piercing Shot (2 uses):</strong> This shot gains <strong>+1 to Attack</strong> (stacks with Tension bonuses).</li>
								<li><strong>Sharp Shot (2 uses):</strong> On hit, target makes a CON save vs your Arbalest DC or becomes <strong>Bleeding</strong> (1d4 damage per turn until treated or staunched).</li>
							</ul>
						</div>

						<div class="arbalest-card control">
							<div class="arbalest-header">
								<h3>Iron Arbalest</h3>
								<span class="arbalest-tag">Control</span>
							</div>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>Concussive Bolt (2 uses):</strong> On hit, target makes a CON save vs your Arbalest DC or becomes <strong>Staggered</strong> (no Move or Action until their next turn; Fast Action and Reaction allowed).</li>
								<li><strong>Scatter Shot (2 uses):</strong> 15-ft cone. Each creature in the cone makes a DEX save vs your DC — full weapon damage on fail, half on success. <em>Does not gain Tension bonuses. Still consumes your current Tension on Fire and requires Load after.</em></li>
							</ul>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Damage Dice per Tier</h2>
						<table class="damage-table">
							<thead>
								<tr>
									<th>Tier</th>
									<th>Damage Dice</th>
								</tr>
							</thead>
							<tbody>
								<tr><td>Tier 1</td><td>1d10 + INT</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 2</td><td>1d12 + INT</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 3</td><td>2d10 + INT</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 4</td><td>2d12 + INT</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 5</td><td>3d10 + INT</td></tr>
							</tbody>
						</table>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Techniques by Tier</h2>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T1 — Tether Shot</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">2 Stamina • Action • Req: Braced</div>
							</div>
							<p>Stake a ground-anchor beneath the target and string 20 ft of slack — now it drags a leash wherever it goes.</p>
							<p><strong>On hit:</strong> Target becomes <strong>Tethered (Arbalest)</strong>. While Tethered: Speed −10 ft. The tether has 20 ft of slack.</p>
							<div class="mechanic-details" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
								<p><strong>Slack Check:</strong> Whenever the target would move beyond its remaining slack, it makes a STR save vs your Arbalest DC.</p>
								<ul>
									<li><strong>Fail:</strong> Falls Prone and movement ends.</li>
									<li><strong>Success:</strong> Extends slack by +5 ft and continues (max +10 ft total).</li>
								</ul>
								<p><strong>Break Attempt:</strong> At the start of its turn, the target may make a STR save vs your DC. Success: tether breaks.</p>
								<p><strong>Flyers:</strong> Altitude is capped by remaining slack. Exceeding it triggers a Slack Check (same rules). Two tethers on a flyer = <strong>Grounded</strong> (no flight) until one breaks.</p>
								<p style="margin-bottom: 0;"><strong>Stacking:</strong> Up to 2 tethers on one target (from any source). Each adds −10 ft Speed; Slack Check DC gains +2 per extra tether.</p>
							</div>
							<p style="margin-top: 1rem;"><em>Being Braced when you fire applies full T1/T2 Tension bonuses to this shot as normal.</em></p>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T2 — Grapnel Switch</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">2 Stamina • Action</div>
							</div>
							<p>Swap to a reversible grapnel head. The bolt lands — then something moves.</p>
							<p><strong>On hit, choose one:</strong></p>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>Pull (target):</strong> Immediately pull the target up to <strong>10 ft toward the impact point</strong>. Large or larger creatures may make a STR save vs your DC to resist.</li>
								<li><strong>Reel-In (you):</strong> You are pulled up to <strong>10 ft toward the impact point</strong>. Stop at safe footing.</li>
							</ul>
							<p><strong>Tether Synergy:</strong> If a Tether Shot is active on that target, it takes <strong>1d6 rending damage</strong> if it moves before your next turn.</p>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T3 — Offload</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">1 Stamina • Reaction • 1/round</div>
							</div>
							<p>Streamline the loop. Load between turns — so your Action is always ready for the perfect Fire window.</p>
							<p><strong>Trigger:</strong> End of any creature's turn, or when you take damage.</p>
							<p><strong>Effect:</strong> Load as a Reaction, gaining <strong>+1 Tension</strong>. If you are Braced, you remain Braced.</p>
							<p><em>This lets you "bank" Tension between turns without spending your Action to Load on your own turn.</em></p>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T4 — Overwatch Intercept</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">1 Stamina • Reaction • 1/round</div>
							</div>
							<p>You've turned your position into a threat. Anything that moves through your lane answers to it.</p>
							<p><strong>Requirement:</strong> You must be Braced.</p>
							<p><strong>Trigger:</strong> A creature moves <strong>≥10 ft in a straight line</strong> within your range.</p>
							<p><strong>The target must choose:</strong></p>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>Stop immediately</strong> — movement ends.</li>
								<li><strong>Continue</strong> — and grant you <strong>Advantage</strong> on the intercept attack.</li>
							</ul>
							<p><strong>Effect:</strong> Fire as a Reaction, consuming your current Tension (if any).</p>
							<p><strong>Miss Risk:</strong> If you fire at Tension 2 and miss, you are <strong>Exposed</strong> until the start of your next turn (attacks against you have Advantage).</p>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T5 — Transfixion Pin</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">4 Stamina • Action • Req: Braced</div>
							</div>
							<p>A flanged siege bolt meant to nail prey to the world. It doesn't just hurt — it stops.</p>
							<p><strong>Shot:</strong> Treat this as a <strong>Tension 2 shot</strong> (ignore 2 AR, +1 Power Die) even if you weren't at Tension 2, then add <strong>+1 extra weapon die</strong> on top.</p>
							<p><strong>On hit — adjacent to solid terrain:</strong> Target makes a STR save vs your Arbalest DC.</p>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>Fail:</strong> <strong>Pinned</strong> for 1 turn — Speed 0 and loses 1 Action on their next turn.</li>
								<li><strong>Success:</strong> <strong>Immobilized</strong> for 1 turn — Speed 0, actions normal.</li>
							</ul>
							<p><strong>On hit — open ground:</strong></p>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>Fail:</strong> Immobilized for 1 turn.</li>
								<li><strong>Success:</strong> Slowed (−10 ft Speed) for 1 turn.</li>
							</ul>
							<p><strong>Large/Huge targets:</strong> Fail → Immobilized; Success → Slowed.</p>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section playstyle">
						<h2>Weapon Playstyle</h2>
						<div class="playstyle-grid">
							<div class="playstyle-card strengths">
								<h3>Strengths</h3>
								<ul>
									<li>Tension 2 shots punch hard through AR — reliable damage against armored targets</li>
									<li>Tether + Overwatch create a deterrence zone the monster has to answer</li>
									<li>Offload lets you bank Tension efficiently without wasting an Action</li>
									<li>Bolt Cartridges give per-hunt flexibility — run offense or control depending on the hunt</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="playstyle-card weaknesses">
								<h3>Weaknesses</h3>
								<ul>
									<li>Completely position-dependent — get shoved, dragged, or knocked down and your setup resets</li>
									<li>Low attack frequency; a missed Fire at T2 and Exposed is a punishing turn</li>
									<li>Shorter range than Bow — can't stay at extreme distance and still threaten effectively</li>
									<li>Stamina-hungry when using techniques back-to-back</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>
				</article>
			</div>
		</main>

		<style>
			* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
			:root {
				--forest-dark: #1a2e1a; --forest-green: #2d5016; --moss-green: #4a7c2f;
				--leaf-green: #6b9d3a; --amber: #d4a257; --earth-brown: #5c4033;
				--cream: #f5f1e8; --text-light: #e8e4d8;
			}
			body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: var(--forest-dark); color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.7; min-height: 100vh; }
			.container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
			.nav { background: var(--forest-green); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--amber); padding: 1rem 0; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
			.nav .container { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; max-width: 1200px; }
			.logo { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--amber); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.2rem; }
			.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; }
			.nav-links a { color: var(--cream); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; transition: color 0.3s; }
			.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--amber); }
			.breadcrumb { padding: 2rem 0 1rem; }
			.breadcrumb a { color: var(--leaf-green); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
			.breadcrumb a:hover { color: var(--amber); }
			.page-header { padding: 2rem 0 3rem; text-align: center; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--amber); margin-bottom: 3rem; }
			.weapon-icon { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.weapon-icon img { width: 540px; height: 540px; object-fit: contain; }
			.page-header h1 { font-size: 3rem; color: var(--amber); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.subtitle { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--leaf-green); font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.stat-badges { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1rem; }
			.stat-badge { padding: 0.5rem 1rem; background: var(--moss-green); color: var(--amber); border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1rem; }
			.content { padding-bottom: 4rem; }
			.weapon-section { background: var(--forest-green); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 2rem; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.weapon-section.highlight { border-color: var(--amber); background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest-green) 0%, var(--moss-green) 100%); }
			.weapon-section h2 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
			.weapon-section h3 { color: var(--leaf-green); font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem; }
			.weapon-section p { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.weapon-section ul { margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.weapon-section li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.attributes-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
			.attribute-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.attribute-card h3 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.attribute-card p { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.attribute-card ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; }
			.attribute-card li { padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.attribute-card li:before { content: "▸"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--amber); }
			.formula { background: var(--moss-green); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid var(--amber); font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-weight: 600; color: var(--amber); text-align: center; }
			.mechanic-details { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 1rem; }
			.mechanic-details p { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
			.mechanic-details ul { margin-left: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
			.mechanic-details li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
			.arbalest-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.arbalest-card.offense { border-color: #c74440; }
			.arbalest-card.control { border-color: #4a7aab; }
			.arbalest-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
			.arbalest-header h3 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0; }
			.arbalest-tag { background: var(--moss-green); padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 6px; color: var(--amber); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; }
			.damage-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: var(--forest-dark); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
			.damage-table th, .damage-table td { padding: 1rem; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.damage-table th { background: var(--moss-green); color: var(--amber); font-weight: 600; }
			.damage-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
			.technique-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--amber); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
			.technique-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.technique-header h3 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 1.75rem; margin: 0; }
			.technique-cost { background: var(--moss-green); padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 6px; color: var(--amber); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; }
			.playstyle-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
			.playstyle-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.playstyle-card.strengths { border-color: var(--leaf-green); }
			.playstyle-card.weaknesses { border-color: #c74440; }
			.playstyle-card h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--amber); }
			.playstyle-card ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; }
			.playstyle-card li { padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
			.playstyle-card li:before { content: "▸"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--amber); }
			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				.nav .container { flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
				.nav-links { gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
				.page-header h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
				.weapon-section { padding: 1.5rem; }
				.technique-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; }
				.arbalest-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.5rem; }
			}
			html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
